<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-034" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-034-jin076-yuxiaofu" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-034-jin076-yuxiaofu">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-034-jin076-yuxiaofu:food" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-034-jin076-yuxiaofu:food:m0000" ref="a6e_72c_a59">虞嘯父</persName>為<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-034-jin076-yuxiaofu:food:m0004" ref="uke_dff_yrf">孝武</persName>侍中，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-034-jin076-yuxiaofu:food:m0009" ref="uke_dff_yrf">帝</persName>從容問曰：「卿在門下，初不聞有所獻替。」虞家富春，近海，謂<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-034-jin076-yuxiaofu:food:m0039" ref="uke_dff_yrf">帝</persName>望其意氣，對曰：「天時尚煗，䱥魚蝦䱹未可致，尋當有所上獻。」<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-034-jin076-yuxiaofu:food:m0070" ref="uke_dff_yrf">帝</persName>撫掌大笑。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-034-jin076-yuxiaofu:kin" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-034-jin076-yuxiaofu:kin:m0000" ref="a6e_72c_a59">嘯父</persName>，會稽人，光祿<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-034-jin076-yuxiaofu:kin:m0009" ref="9v9_cj5_dor">潭</persName>之孫，右將軍<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-034-jin076-yuxiaofu:kin:m0016" ref="9v9_cj5_dor_A">純</persName>之子。少歷顯位，與<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-034-jin076-yuxiaofu:kin:m0026" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFA">王廞</persName>同廢為庶人。義旗初，為會稽內史。</p>
</text>
